                        ║  [q] exit epic   [Esc] clear sel   [gg/[ / G/]] jump top/bottom      ║
                        ║                                                                      ║
                        ║  Actions                                                             ║
                        ║  [n] new task   [E] new epic   [N] notifications                     ║
