                        ║  [d] dispatch*  [H/L] move task/epic backward/forward                ║
                        ║  [x] done/arch  [D] quick dsp  [Space] session/board (gg: top)       ║
                        ║  [l/→] Archive   [a] select all   [/] search titles/ids              ║
                        ║  [v] select  [f] filter repos  [A] filter active                     ║
                        ║  [T] detach tmux panel  (any task with a tmux window, supports batch)║
                        ║  [s] toggle split  [S] swap task into pane                           ║
                        ║  [p] open PR  [:] main session (jump/pick dir)  [o] sync repo        ║
                        ║  [J/K] reorder item up/down  [P] todo (a add · space done · J/K order║
